PROPRIETARY AND CONFIDENTIAL

This repository contains the datasets, MATLAB scripts, and topological network 
models associated with the Master of Science thesis: "Topological Network Analysis 
of Papua New Guinea Development Indicator System (1960–2025)" (Papua New Guinea 
University of Technology, 2026).

Unauthorized copying, modification, distribution, publication, or commercial use 
of these files, via any medium, is strictly prohibited without the prior written 
permission of the copyright holder. Academic examiners and authorized reviewers 
are granted permission solely to view and execute the code for thesis evaluation.
